mEVO is a complex GPS tracking solution for any type of stationary or moving objective.

The platform can be adapted to any field of activity, being mainly a complete system for managing fleets by GPS.

The mobile application is easy to use and offers access to the following features:

- View the current location of vehicles on the map;
- Detailed information on the last known location of the vehicle (including address, date and time, speed);
- Viewing the route on the map;
- Summary of vehicle activity;
- Notifications in the interface.

Access to the application is based on a valid EVO GPS account.
